OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F348A1785613679
OL,3,CChief Constable would've been
OL,4,Cdismissed if he had not already quit
OL,6,FA former Staffordshire Police Chief
OL,7,FConstable would've been dismissed if
OL,8,Fhe had not already quit after a panel
OL,9,Ffound he committed gross misconduct, a
OL,10,Fhearing has been told.
OL,12,FChristopher Noble was suspended from
OL,13,Fthe top job at Staffordshire Police in
OL,14,FAugust last year but resigned on
OL,15,FTuesday, the day before he was due to
OL,16,Fface a misconduct hearing.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G1/9
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,349,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34802
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F348A1785613679
OL,3,CChief Constable would've been
OL,4,Cdismissed if he had not already quit
OL,6,FAt the conclusion of the police
OL,7,Fdisciplinary hearing at a
OL,8,FStaffordshire conference centre on
OL,9,FThursday (July 30th) the panel found
OL,10,Fthe allegations against Noble proven.
OL,12,FThe details of his misconduct cannot
OL,13,Fbe outlined because of reporting
OL,14,Frestrictions imposed by the panel,
OL,15,Fdespite legal representations from the
OL,16,Fmedia.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G2/9
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,349,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34803
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F348A1785613679
OL,3,CChief Constable would've been
OL,4,Cdismissed if he had not already quit
OL,6,FThe chairwoman of the panel, former
OL,7,Fparliamentary commissioner for
OL,8,Fstandards Kathryn Stone, said Mr
OL,9,FNoble, who did not attend the hearing,
OL,10,Fhad breached the standards of
OL,11,Fprofessional behaviour.
OL,13,FMs Stone, of HM Inspectorate of
OL,14,FConstabulary and Fire and Rescue
OL,15,FServices, said the breaches were so
OL,16,Fserious as to be gross misconduct and
OL,17,Fthat Mr Noble would have been
OL,18,Fdismissed if he had not already
OL,19,Fresigned.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G3/9
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
