CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F348A1785613679
OL,3,CChief Constable would've been
OL,4,Cdismissed if he had not already quit
OL,6,FNoble, who was appointed as chief
OL,7,Fconstable after moving to the force
OL,8,Ffrom Humberside Police, tendered his
OL,9,Fresignation in a letter to Ben Adams,
OL,10,Fthe Staffordshire commissioner for
OL,11,Fpolice, fire and crime ` the man who
OL,12,Fappointed him in 2021.
OL,14,FHe began his police career with the
OL,15,FRUC in Northern Ireland and was later
OL,16,Fthe head of the Police Service of
OL,17,FNorthern Ireland's head of
OL,18,FProfessional Standards and Counter
OL,19,FCorruption.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G4/9
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,349,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34805
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F348A1785613679
OL,3,CChief Constable would've been
OL,4,Cdismissed if he had not already quit
OL,6,FIn a statement on Wednesday (July
OL,7,F29th), Mr Adams said: "I can confirm
OL,8,Fthat yesterday I received chief
OL,9,Fconstable Chris Noble's resignation,
OL,10,Fwhich I have accepted with immediate
OL,11,Feffect."Becky Riggs will remain as
OL,12,FStaffordshire Police's Acting Chief
OL,13,FConstable."
OL,15,FAt the conclusion of the proceedings,
OL,16,FMr Adams said in a statement: "Public
OL,17,Fconfidence in policing is vital, so
OL,18,Fall allegations of misconduct must be
OL,19,Ffully and independently investigated.
OL,20,FThat process must apply to everyone,
OL,21,Fregardless of rank or status.
OL,26,@oD@WOUsD@HOUuD@KO]xD@_OU
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G5/9
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,349,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34806
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F348A1785613679
OL,3,CChief Constable would've been
OL,4,Cdismissed if he had not already quit
OL,6,F"Now that this independent process has
OL,7,Fconcluded, Staffordshire Police can
OL,8,Fmove forward."The challenges facing
OL,9,Fthe force, including those identified
OL,10,Fby His Majesty's Inspectorate of
OL,11,FConstabulary and Fire & Rescue
OL,12,FServices in its recent report, remain
OL,13,Fmy focus.
OL,15,F"I will now take steps to bring the
OL,16,Fpermanence and stability needed in the
OL,17,Fforce's leadership, so we can continue
OL,18,Fimproving services for the communities
OL,19,Fof Staffordshire and Stoke-on-Trent."
OL,26,@nD@AOUpD@NOUwD@AOU{D@eO]
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G6/9
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,349,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34807
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F348A1785613679
OL,3,CChief Constable would've been
OL,4,Cdismissed if he had not already quit
OL,6,FUntil his resignation, Noble had been
OL,7,Fone of eight serving or former chief
OL,8,Fconstables under misconduct
OL,9,Finvestigation or who were awaiting
OL,10,Flinked proceedings, the IOPC said.
OL,12,FIOPC director general Rachel Watson
OL,13,Fsaid: "As the police complaints
OL,14,Fwatchdog, we are uniquely placed to
OL,15,Fidentify issues, areas of concern and
OL,16,Fways to improve policing.
OL,26,@uD@GOU
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G7/9
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,349,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34808
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F348A1785613679
OL,3,CChief Constable would've been
OL,4,Cdismissed if he had not already quit
OL,6,F"I do believe most chief officers do a
OL,7,Fgood job in challenging circumstances.
OL,8,FBut too often our investigations are
OL,9,Funcovering longstanding, unreported
OL,10,Fconcerns about their behaviour.
OL,12,F"Concerns need to be raised and heard
OL,13,Flong before someone is considered
OL,14,Fsuitable for appointment to the chief
OL,15,Fofficer rank.
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@AOU
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G8/9
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,349,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34809
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F348A1785613679
OL,3,CChief Constable would've been
OL,4,Cdismissed if he had not already quit
OL,6,F"Police leaders set the culture for
OL,7,Fpolice forces so it's vital the right
OL,8,Fpeople occupy chief officer positions
OL,9,F` people with effective leadership
OL,10,Fskills and who come from diverse
OL,11,Fbackgrounds, including experience away
OL,12,Ffrom policing.
OL,14,F"People should not reach chief officer
OL,15,Franks simply because their face
OL,16,F'fits'."
OL,26,@nD@AOUvD@AOUxD@HO]
